// The per-owner Durable Object (ADR-032, amended by ADR-034). Edge Workers bind OWNER to
// this class by script_name from their own configs. This Worker binds four services: FILES,
// the files Worker, which itself binds no Durable Object and no service; GATEWAY, the model
// gateway, which binds nothing at all; CODEMODE_VM, the codemode Worker, which binds only its
// own class, where code mode's VMs run; and SANDBOX, the sandbox Worker, which binds only its
// own classes, the control record and the ring queue, and reaches nothing but E2B; so none
// is a way to another owner's object. It binds no Durable Object namespace. Its one store is
// CONTROL, the platform's control record alone (the doors' namespace of it, whose id the
// deploy kit writes), which code mode's calls read for the gates the door read; it holds no
// owner's state. ERASURES is the erasure queue's producer, which tells the doors an erasure's
// outside record is due. `disable_ctx_exports` keeps the runtime from handing the object its
// own namespaces as `ctx.exports` (guards/config.test.ts checks this config and every Worker
// it binds).
// `limits.subrequests` is the platform's per-invocation count of the calls the object
// makes (FILES and the gateway as subrequests), reset as the work moves across events
// (live probe P1, `store-probe.md`: at 10,000, calls stopped at exactly 10,000 in one
// alarm; at 1,000,000 they passed); the platform's own error is the loud failure, and the
// object keeps no budget of its own. It is Paid's documented most, 10,000,000 (Workers
// limits: "10,000 (up to 10M)"); P1 ran at 1,000,000, so a live check at the most is owed;
// pinned by the config guard. Its one secret, ROUTING_KEYRING (made with keyring-new and set
// in the doors Worker too), is the keyring the sandbox tokens are MAC'd and their routes sealed
// under (contract/src/routing-mac.ts); `secrets.required` makes a deploy without it fail.
{
  "$schema": "../node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "tinyassets-owner",
  "main": "src/index.ts",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-23",
  "observability": { "enabled": true },
  "compatibility_flags": ["nodejs_compat", "disable_ctx_exports"],
  "workers_dev": false,
  "preview_urls": false,
  "limits": { "subrequests": 10000000 },
  "secrets": { "required": ["ROUTING_KEYRING"] },
  "kv_namespaces": [
    { "binding": "CONTROL", "id": "not-provisioned-control" }
  ],
  "services": [
    { "binding": "FILES", "service": "tinyassets-files" },
    { "binding": "GATEWAY", "service": "tinyassets-gateway" },
    { "binding": "CODEMODE_VM", "service": "tinyassets-codemode" },
    { "binding": "SANDBOX", "service": "tinyassets-sandbox" }
  ],
  "queues": {
    "producers": [
      { "binding": "ERASURES", "queue": "tinyassets-erasure" }
    ]
  },
  "migrations": [
    { "tag": "v1", "new_sqlite_classes": ["OwnerDO"] }
  ]
}
